        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-020461",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We continue to invest in research and development to ensure our products meet the needs of our customers.",
        "start_character": 9364,
        "end_character": 9469
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-020461",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-020461-1b4cb5fbba4f8d81",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-020461",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We continue to work diligently to ensure that manufacturing and operating expense levels remain well aligned to business conditions.",
        "start_character": 3340,
        "end_character": 3472
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-020461",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-020461-1b4cb5fbba4f8d81",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-020461",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We devote a significant portion of our personnel and financial resources to research and development programs and seek to maintain close relationships with our customers to remain responsive to their product needs.",
        "start_character": 21813,
        "end_character": 22027
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-020461",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-020461-1b4cb5fbba4f8d81",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-020461",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have also sought to reduce the development cycle for new products through a collaborative process whereby our engineering, manufacturing and marketing personnel work closely together with one another and with our customers at an earlier stage in the process.",
        "start_character": 22028,
        "end_character": 22289
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-020461",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-020461-1b4cb5fbba4f8d81",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-020461",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We manufacture products at our 417,000 square feet ISO 9001:2015, ISO 4001:2015 and ISO 45001:2018 certified plant in Beverly, Massachusetts as well as our 38,000 square feet ISO 4001:2015 and ISO 45001:2018 certified Axcelis Asia Operations Center in South Korea and our 101,800 square feet state-of-the-art logistics and flex manufacturing Axcelis Logistics Center in Beverly, Massachusetts.",
